## Part 2: 1420710 e5 d=6 root-cause diagnosis

### Files

- `benchmarks/w44_155_run_dumps.sh` (NEW dump runner)
- `benchmarks/w44_155_analyze.py` (NEW analyzer)
- `benchmarks/w44_155_1420710_e5_d6_diagnosis_2026-05-21.txt` (analysis output)
- `/tmp/w44_155_dumps/e5_d{5,6}_{ours,cjxl}/per_block_*.tsv` (dumps)

### Method

Re-used W44-76 per-block dump infrastructure (env-var-gated `JXL_W44_76_PER_BLOCK_DUMP`).
Encoded 1420710.png at e5 d=5 and e5 d=6 with both cjxl-rs (ours, W44-154
baseline at `f9235ce4`) and `libjxl--w44-76-per-block-debug-dump` cjxl
binary. Dumped `(bx, by, strategy_wire, channel, num_nonzeros, qac)` per
block.

